Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 03:02:47 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat: fairy rings (dial, travel log, Zanaris and
 Last-destination)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Problem:
Fairy rings have no content: the rings' Zanaris, Configure and Last-destination ops do nothing.

Change:
- New module on the cache's fairyring dbtable: Configure opens the dial (398) with the travel
  log (381); dial buttons and 'Use code' set fairyring_1..3; Confirm, Zanaris and
  Last-destination teleport (fairyring_lastloc_opvis drives the op text); the log lists visited
  codes (server varps 63784-63785).
- A code with no ring, or the ring you stand in, does not move you and the player says "Wow,
  fairy magic sure is useful, I hardly moved at all!".
- The network needs a Dramen staff, the Lunar staff, or an unfinished Lunar staff (pt1..pt3)
  in hand; with the elite Lumbridge & Draynor diary (varbit lumbridge_diary_elite_complete) no
  staff is needed. Without either: "The fairy rings only work for those who wield fairy magic."
  Zanaris also works without a staff from the rings only the network reaches (cache column).
- Quest gate: Fairytale I complete and Fairytale II at least past the Fairy Godfather's
  permission (stage 40), through QuestRequirements like the other quest-gated content: the
  default assume-completed mode lets everyone in; respect-progress reads the real stages (the
  two quests are not implemented, so it refuses everyone).
- On teleport the travel log's mobile search input (meslayer mode 28, opened by the client) is
  closed with meslayer_close: meslayer_ondialogabort does not cover mode 28.

Tests:
- FairyRingScriptTest (integration): dbtable row ids match the dial positions; the nine unused
  codes and the house ring have no fixed destination; each staff (Dramen, Lunar, pt1..pt3)
  opens the dial; no staff is refused with the message; the elite diary needs no staff;
  respect-progress refuses players without the Fairytale quests; the gate needs both quests.

Data sources:
- OSRS Wiki: Fairy ring (intro, Using fairy rings, Combinations, Unused combinations, Changes,
  Trivia), Zanaris, Dramen staff, Lunar staff, Lunar staff - pt1.
- Quest Helper FairytaleII.java: quest varbit 2326 (fairy2_queencure_quest) >= 40 once the Fairy
  Godfather has been spoken to for the fairy rings.
- Cache: fairyring dbtable; interfaces fairyrings / fairyrings_log; loc 29495/29560 ops and the
  fairyring_lastloc_opvis op text; obj 772, 9084, 9091-9093.

Caveats:
- No refusal line for a player without the quests is documented: the no-staff line is reused.
- The teleport timing (vanish anim + flower-ring spotanim, 3 ticks, appear anim) is a guess;
  whether "hardly moved" also plays them is a guess too.
- "The ring you stand in" is a guess: within 3 tiles (Chebyshev) of a ring's destination tile.
- Last-destination with no previous code silently does nothing (the op is hidden then).
- Favourites, the Fairy Resistance Hideout sequence (AIR, DLR, DJQ, AJS), per-ring quest
  requirements (AJQ, BJR, BJS, AIS/AJP, AKP, ...), the 1/6 ambient NPC spawns at seven rings and
  the off-hand item hiding during the teleport are not done.

